{"v":4,"catch":"體驗「XEVIOUS」的進一步進化！ ！","desc":"《SUPER XEVIOUS》是NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment）於1984年推出的射擊遊戲。\n\n玩家駕駛 SOLVALOU 與 XEVIOUS 勢力對峙。\n使用zapper擊敗空中敵人，使用blaster擊敗地面敵人。\n遊戲與之前的遊戲相比有許多變化，包括額外的角色和隱藏物品的不同位置。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2025-05-01","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d26c956b3be76cd1a06c84a20ddc5bc94f2e25b794194b5cdf55252c6ac0b778.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/48cc032d674f065455701bdc67d35b9f53088344c5076602a0c7d28dc5ce3d6e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1987eaedca0b0faea9bd9cf4a05ebb69ebdf5280ea6a73cc2b3e9735ec27e17a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e5e89c018da0987967f3dfe8e072600a6678035101642eb537c1bee7252ecfcb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/20039556435e6053fc1d9168a007f1b77e5a8e7daf3681ca4173a204f3fe1797.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1542802f0e5ae9dc4e42cd44e5786348cbe7fe88073484b2be025a7149ffe933.jpg"],"titleId":"0100196021724000","dlc":[]}